import json,html
out=Path('verification/cycle-five')
inventory=[
['Madame Zora','Cycle Four: entry button, two premise paragraphs and a prose payoff. Normal game: scenic tent.','Keep one tangible object as invitation; show inspection and consequence. Close remains a consistent escape; screen readers receive concise equivalent descriptions.','Cycle Five implemented only behind flag.'],
['Hall of Mirrors','Heading, touch-the-glass hint, written reflection descriptions; three required inspections unlock a text route.','Let the glass distort and the final passage visibly open. Keep an accessible status, and do not call mandatory inspection a taste choice.','Proposal only.'],
['Midway / poster','Examine poster and return controls coexist with visual reactions, Mara and puddle interactions.','Keep the poster’s in-world lettering. Let object motion acknowledge inspection; one consistent retreat gesture. Preserve readable accessibility names.','Proposal only; Mara’s reaction is not morality evidence.'],
['Forest’s Edge','Painted routes and exit sign; no written story choice to remove.','Add a consequence from a kept object before adding a questionnaire. Do not remove sign text merely to achieve wordlessness.','Proposal only.'],
['Carousel','Mechanical artwork wheel already wordless; pause/resume expressed through mount selection. Ride HUD provides name/status/return.','Preserve the approved wheel. Retain clear escape and motion/accessibility status; a scoreless ride is valuable.','Unchanged.'],
['Skee-Ball','Short angle/pull hint and score/remaining balls.','Keep essential rules and scores; an optional physical aiming demonstration could supplement instructions. Keyboard controls must remain discoverable.','No change; performance is not literary preference.'],
['Navigation / opening','Scene signs, geographic hotspots, look controls, age-band names, some textual return/onward controls.','Use shared examine/approach/return affordances, not a blanket text purge. Preserve age labels, destinations for assistive technology and safe exits.','Do not rebuild navigation.']]
